# Qwen Rules — Heroes of Might and Magic: Arena

## Development Server Policy

- DO NOT automatically run development servers (npm run dev, vite, etc.) after making changes
- The user will manually run and test the project themselves
- Only run build commands (npm run build, tsc --noEmit) when explicitly requested to verify compilation

## Project Overview

- **Goal:** Create a clone of Heroes of Might and Magic (HoMM3-style)
- **Starting Point:** "Arena" mode — turn-based tactical battle
- **Tech Stack:** TypeScript, PixiJS, Vite

## Arena Mode Core Rules

- Two sides (attacker and defender)
- Each side has 1–7 creature stacks
- Hexagonal grid battlefield (like HoMM3)
- Turn order determined by creature initiative
- Creatures move and act in initiative order

