- VictoryConditionManager: tracks win/lose conditions
  - Victory/defeat determined by side: if all stacks of one side are destroyed (count <= 0), that side loses
  - Monitors alive stacks for attackers and defenders
  - Auto-checks victory condition on each stack death
  - Emits `battleEnded` event with outcome (victory/defeat)
- VictoryScreen: end-of-battle overlay
  - Shows "ПОБЕДА!" (gold) or "ПОРАЖЕНИЕ" (red) with subtitle
  - "Заново" button to restart the battle
  - Responsive to screen resize
- BattleManager integration
  - `applyDamage()` updates HP bar after damage
  - `removeStack()` triggers death animation and notifies VictoryManager
  - `getVictoryManager()` exposes VictoryConditionManager
